    "intro_narrative": "You are Detective Vance, tasked with infiltrating the abandoned hideout of 'The Silhouette,' a notorious cyber-criminal who recently vanished. The room before you is a chaotic mix of old-school physical clues and high-tech digital forensic equipment. Your objective is clear: navigate this maze of encrypted archives, fragmented scripts, and physical evidence to secure the master access code left behind in the final evidence locker. Time is of the essence, as the local network is set to self-destruct in one hour. You must gather the scattered files, decode the syndicate's traces, and piece together the digital breadcrumbs to crack the case.",
